  \title{All the Transformer Math You Need to Know}
  \exercise{4.1}{parameter counting}{
How many parameters does a model with D=4096 , F=4⋅D, V=32,000, and L=64 have? What fraction of these are attention parameters? How large are our KV caches per token? You can assume N⋅H=D and multi-head attention with int8 KVs.}{
  }
}
